message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below, and cite OpenAI's quasi-Riemann hypothesis preprint for the 7/8 half-plane."
title: "A kernel-checked bound Lambda <= 9/32 for the de Bruijn-Newman constant from OpenAI's quasi-Riemann hypothesis"
authors:
